# side track O, O.2: the determinism gate's recording (ci-arty-gb): the
# sync bit, then keys changed at odd moments, mid-frame; arty-sim
# --movie-record takes them at the frame toggles, as the PS app does
bytes 0xF01003 01
wait 41234
keys 0x0001
wait 23456
keys 0x0011
wait 37777
keys 0x0000
wait 9999
keys 0x0080
wait 51111
keys 0x0024
wait 17321
keys 0x0000
wait 60000
